      "text": "DIVERGE\n\ngenerating options\n\"yes, and \u2014 what else?\"\nfails by never stopping \u00b7 feels wasteful",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DIVERGE\n\ngenerating options\n\"yes, and \u2014 what else?\"\nfails by never stopping \u00b7 feels wasteful",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 16
