      "text": "Almost every bad meeting you will sit in is a room trying to do both at once.\nSay out loud which one you are doing: \"we're still diverging \u2014 hold the objections for ten minutes.\"",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Almost every bad meeting you will sit in is a room trying to do both at once.\nSay out loud which one you are doing: \"we're still diverging \u2014 hold the objections for ten minutes.\"",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 15
    },
